{"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Distances\/documentation\/Distances\/Eccentricities"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Distances\/documentation\/Distances\/GraphProtocols"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/distances"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Distances\/documentation\/Distances","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","externalID":"Distances","modules":[{"name":"Distances"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"Distances"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Distances/documentation/Distances":{"abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Distances","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Distances\/documentation\/Distances","url":"\/documentation\/distances"},"doc://Distances/documentation/Distances/Eccentricities":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Eccentricities","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex’s eccentricity, computed once (Boost’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"all_eccentricities"},{"type":"text","text":"), with the measures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that follow from them: the radius (the least), the diameter (the greatest), the center and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the periphery (the vertices that attain them). An eccentricity is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", standing for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"infinity, when some vertex is not reachable from the vertex; so the diameter is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the graph is not connected (or not strongly connected), and the radius when no vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches every vertex."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Distances\/documentation\/Distances\/Eccentricities","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/distances\/eccentricities","title":"Eccentricities","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Eccentricities","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Distances/documentation/Distances/GraphProtocols":{"abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"GraphProtocols","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/distances\/graphprotocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/Distances\/documentation\/Distances\/GraphProtocols"}}}